    "safehtml": "<div>\n<p>Dear <span class=\"dataslug\" id=\"TemplateEditor0\" data-value=\"{!contact:fullname;Valued Customer}\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background-color: #E7EFFF;\">{!Contact:Full Name;Valued Customer}</span>,</p>\n<p>We have not heard from you for a while. We wanted to check in and make sure that you are still having a great experience using our product(s). We have asked\n<span class=\"dataslug\" id=\"TemplateEditor1\" data-value=\"{!contact:ownerid/@name;a customer service representative}\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background-color: #E7EFFF;\">{!Contact:Owner;a customer service representative}</span> to contact you next week to get your feedback on the product(s) you are currently\n using and to give you details about our upcoming products.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n</div>\n",
